{"id":"8d50da078de7aa54","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-hecke-algebra.md","title":"Hecke Algebra","display":"df-hecke-algebra — Hecke Algebra","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-hecke-algebra","aliases":["58-df-hecke-algebra"],"display":"df-hecke-algebra — Hecke Algebra","depends_on":["[[58-df-modular-form]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[58-df-vector-space]]","[[58-df-linear-map]]","[[58-df-ring]]","[[58-df-zfc-algebra2-subring]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-hecke-algebra"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-hecke-algebra</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-hecke-algebra — Hecke Algebra"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a891b0f45131631a\" href=\"?note=a891b0f45131631a\" title=\"58-df-modular-form\">58-df-modular-form</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"592f9cfb66a507c2\" href=\"?note=592f9cfb66a507c2\" title=\"58-df-vector-space\">58-df-vector-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f67456d74b418241\" href=\"?note=f67456d74b418241\" title=\"58-df-linear-map\">58-df-linear-map</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1c30d21ea7b443f6\" href=\"?note=1c30d21ea7b443f6\" title=\"58-df-ring\">58-df-ring</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"081edc5d75e10718\" href=\"?note=081edc5d75e10718\" title=\"58-df-zfc-algebra2-subring\">58-df-zfc-algebra2-subring</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma,k,M,T,\\mathbb T\\in V\">\\(\\Gamma,k,M,T,\\mathbb T\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ModularForm}_S(f,k,\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathrm{ModularForm}_S(f,k,\\Gamma)\\)</span> is the exact modular-form predicate</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb C}\">\\(\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb C}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ring}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{Ring}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2Subring}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2Subring}_S\\)</span> are used with their registered signatures</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ComplexEndomorphismRing}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ComplexEndomorphismRing}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GeneratedUnitalSubring}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{GeneratedUnitalSubring}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HeckeAlgebra}_S(\\mathbb T,T,M,k,\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathrm{HeckeAlgebra}_S(\\mathbb T,T,M,k,\\Gamma)\\)</span> are defined here</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hecke\\text{-}endomorphism\\text{-}ring}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ComplexEndomorphismRing}_S(E;M,+_M,\\odot_M,0_M,+_E,\\cdot_E,0_E,1_E)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb C}(M,+_M,\\odot_M)\n\\land E=\\{f\\in M^M:\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S(f,M,M,\\mathbb C,+_M,\\odot_M,+_M,\\odot_M)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land0_M\\in M\n\\land\\forall x\\in M\\;\\bigl(+_M(\\langle0_M,x\\rangle)=x\\land+_M(\\langle x,0_M\\rangle)=x\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\operatorname{Ring}_S(E,+_E,\\cdot_E,0_E,1_E)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall F,G\\in E\\;\\forall x\\in M\\;\\Bigl(\n+_E(\\langle F,G\\rangle)(x)=+_M(\\langle F(x),G(x)\\rangle)\n\\land\\cdot_E(\\langle F,G\\rangle)(x)=F(G(x))\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall x\\in M\\;\\bigl(0_E(x)=0_M\\land1_E(x)=x\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hecke\\text{-}endomorphism\\text{-}ring}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ComplexEndomorphismRing}_S(E;M,+_M,\\odot_M,0_M,+_E,\\cdot_E,0_E,1_E)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb C}(M,+_M,\\odot_M)\n\\land E=\\{f\\in M^M:\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S(f,M,M,\\mathbb C,+_M,\\odot_M,+_M,\\odot_M)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land0_M\\in M\n\\land\\forall x\\in M\\;\\bigl(+_M(\\langle0_M,x\\rangle)=x\\land+_M(\\langle x,0_M\\rangle)=x\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\operatorname{Ring}_S(E,+_E,\\cdot_E,0_E,1_E)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall F,G\\in E\\;\\forall x\\in M\\;\\Bigl(\n+_E(\\langle F,G\\rangle)(x)=+_M(\\langle F(x),G(x)\\rangle)\n\\land\\cdot_E(\\langle F,G\\rangle)(x)=F(G(x))\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall x\\in M\\;\\bigl(0_E(x)=0_M\\land1_E(x)=x\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hecke\\text{-}generated\\text{-}unital\\text{-}subring}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GeneratedUnitalSubring}_S(A,E,+_E,\\cdot_E,0_E,1_E,S)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2Subring}_S(A,E,+_E,\\cdot_E,0_E,1_E)\n\\land S\\subseteq A\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall B\\subseteq E\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2Subring}_S(B,E,+_E,\\cdot_E,0_E,1_E)\n\\land S\\subseteq B\\to A\\subseteq B\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hecke\\text{-}generated\\text{-}unital\\text{-}subring}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GeneratedUnitalSubring}_S(A,E,+_E,\\cdot_E,0_E,1_E,S)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2Subring}_S(A,E,+_E,\\cdot_E,0_E,1_E)\n\\land S\\subseteq A\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall B\\subseteq E\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2Subring}_S(B,E,+_E,\\cdot_E,0_E,1_E)\n\\land S\\subseteq B\\to A\\subseteq B\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hecke\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{HeckeAlgebra}_S(\\mathbb T,T,M,k,\\Gamma)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\n\\land M=\\{f\\in\\mathbb C^{\\mathcal H}:\\mathrm{ModularForm}_S(f,k,\\Gamma)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\exists E,+_M,\\odot_M,0_M,+_E,\\cdot_E,0_E,1_E\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ComplexEndomorphismRing}_S(E;M,+_M,\\odot_M,0_M,+_E,\\cdot_E,0_E,1_E)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{50mm}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(T,\\mathbb N_{\\geq1},E)\n\\land\\mathrm{GeneratedUnitalSubring}_S\n(\\mathbb T,E,+_E,\\cdot_E,0_E,1_E,\\operatorname{ran}(T))\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hecke\\text{-}algebra}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{HeckeAlgebra}_S(\\mathbb T,T,M,k,\\Gamma)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow k\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\n\\land M=\\{f\\in\\mathbb C^{\\mathcal H}:\\mathrm{ModularForm}_S(f,k,\\Gamma)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\exists E,+_M,\\odot_M,0_M,+_E,\\cdot_E,0_E,1_E\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ComplexEndomorphismRing}_S(E;M,+_M,\\odot_M,0_M,+_E,\\cdot_E,0_E,1_E)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{50mm}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(T,\\mathbb N_{\\geq1},E)\n\\land\\mathrm{GeneratedUnitalSubring}_S\n(\\mathbb T,E,+_E,\\cdot_E,0_E,1_E,\\operatorname{ran}(T))\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The modular-form carrier, complex endomorphism ring, pointwise addition, composition product, and least generated unital subring are now bound explicitly; the former <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M_k(\\Gamma)\">\\(M_k(\\Gamma)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{End}_{\\mathbb C}(M)\">\\(\\operatorname{End}_{\\mathbb C}(M)\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ZAlgGenerated}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{ZAlgGenerated}_S\\)</span> notations had no source relations.</li>\n<li>Commutativity requires the Hecke relations and is a downstream theorem.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-modular-form","status":"resolved","id":"a891b0f45131631a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-modular-form]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-vector-space","status":"resolved","id":"592f9cfb66a507c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-vector-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-linear-map","status":"resolved","id":"f67456d74b418241","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-linear-map]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ring","status":"resolved","id":"1c30d21ea7b443f6","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ring]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-algebra2-subring","status":"resolved","id":"081edc5d75e10718","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zf